  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fde9e6c05e247ec4ea9eba8397b000e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: Beware
  context: If you're reading this, turn back while you still can. The heat from the
    lava grows unbearable, and one wrong step will be your last. I never made it
    across, but I caught a glimpse of an artifact on the other side. If you choose
    to cross, watch your footing. Don't let the same fate claim you.
  logbookBook: {fileID: 550234188}
